Work in the hiyroscript/alva repository on the current main branch.

Implement an improvement to #0001’s Charged BA1 Clone Attack.

Goal

The clone already spawns behind the opponent and performs ground BA1.

Keep that exact behavior whenever there is valid ground/support behind the opponent.

However, when the normal behind-the-opponent spawn point has no ground/support at the opponent’s current foot height, the clone must instead:

1. spawn directly above/on top of the opponent,
2. use #0001’s existing midairBa2 animation/attack,
3. hit downward using midairBa2’s existing combat data,
4. then vanish normally through the existing clone cloud.

Do not create a new attack or new artwork. Reuse the existing midairBa2.

